@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Nurses (demo data)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/nurses

### Generate draft
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schedules/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{"startDate":"2026-09-14","days":7,"requiredPerShift":2}

### Invalid date must return 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schedules/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{"startDate":"invalid","days":7,"requiredPerShift":2}
